+## Media: `winedmo.prx` and `winegstreamer.prx`
+
+A package built with an FFmpeg checkout (`tools/build_ffmpeg_ps5.sh`) plays
+games' videos and compressed sound. `winegstreamer.prx` (the decoders, and
+the parser behind DirectShow's splitters, the WM reader and Media
+Foundation's sources) and `winedmo.prx` (Media Foundation's other demuxer)
+are Wine's own code, covered
+above; each statically links [FFmpeg](https://ffmpeg.org) 8.1.3's
+libavformat, libavcodec, libswscale, libswresample and libavutil, under the
+GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1 or later
+(`LICENSES/ffmpeg/COPYING.LGPLv2.1`; `LICENSES/ffmpeg/LICENSE.md` is
+FFmpeg's own account of its licences). Only FFmpeg's LGPL parts are built:
+the build stops if its configuration turns on anything under the GPL or
+nonfree, and no external library is linked. `SOURCES.txt` names the commit.
+A package without these modules carries none of this.
+
